<title>GERMANY: Munich Re 96/97 premium income up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Munich Re 96/97 premium income up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996/1997 business year to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group gross premium income	     32,000  vs 29,000</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Muenchener Rueckversicherungs-AG, or Munich Re. The figure for 1996/1997 is preliminary.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
